  Definitely.  Remember, every two points you lower your AC (once you're
below 0) will average saving one point of damage per hit.  When mobbed
and getting hit 4-8 times per round that multiplies up in a hurry.
(Sleepy managed to die on the Plain of Fire despite having 600 Hp and
AC:-46.)

  E.g. a +5 small shield minimizes the effect on spell casting and
should still have 3 HP per hit.  When mobbed in a Summoning Storm and
struggling for the portal you could easily average being hit four times
a round.  That's up to 12 hp saved per round.  After ten rounds that's
120 Hp.  

  Those look high even to me, but you could get hit up to 7 times per
round instead: 21 hit-points saved.


